School Management System – PRD, TRD aur Flow Design
Version: 1.0 (Draft, aapki manzoori ke liye) | Date: 23 November 2026 | Type: Frontend-only demo (dummy data)
1. Project ka Khulasa
Ye ek web app hai jo school owner / principal ke liye banayi ja rahi hai. Is mein bachon ka record, fee, teachers ki salary, kharche aur simple stock ek hi jagah manage hota hai. Fee baqi walon ko call aur WhatsApp reminder bhi yahin se hoga.
Is phase ki sab se zaroori baat: ye abhi sirf Frontend hai. Backend aur database nahi hoga. Saari API mock (dummy) hongi jo frontend ke andar chalti hain, taake client ko poora system chalta hua nazar aaye. Baad mein asli backend aur database lagana chahein to mock API ki jagah asli API jor di jaye, pages ko badalna nahi parega.
Demo Banner (har page ke upar)
Har page ke sab se upar ek banner hoga, Roman Urdu mein:
"Ye system school principal ke liye bahut useful hai. Yahan aap apna kharcha waghera likh sakte hain. Agar aap koi aur item ya feature add karwana chahein to humein bata dein, hum add kar denge."
• Banner par chhota sa X (band) ka button hoga; band karne par session ke liye hide ho jayega, dobara page reload par phir aa jayega.
• Ye banner demo ke liye hai, final product mein ek config switch se hata sakte hain.
2. Scope (Kya hoga, kya nahi hoga)
2.1 Is system mein ye hoga
1.  Login: username, email aur password. Login ke baad upar user ka naam nazar aayega.
2.  Dashboard: kitne bache hain, kitne active/inactive, class wise kitne, fee kitni aayi aur kitni baqi, kitne teachers ko salary di aur kitno ko nahi, is mahine ka kharcha.
3.  Students aur Classes: Montessori se 10th tak class wise list. Naam, father ka naam, phone, family number, admission ki date, B-Form. Fee baqi ho to ghar call karne ka button.
4.  Fees: monthly voucher khud ban jaye, late fee, maafi, receipt, defaulters ki list.
5.  Teachers aur Salary: teacher ka record, kis ko kitni salary deni hai, kis ko de di aur kis ko nahi, salary slip.
6.  Kharche (Expenses): bijli, kiraya, stationery waghera. Owner khud kuch bhi add kar sake, kis ko kitna diya, aur monthly report.
7.  Stock: library ki kitabein, uniform waghera. Simple: kitna hai aur naya add karna. Khareed ka kharcha Kharche wale section mein hi likha jayega.
8.  WhatsApp message: fee reminder bhejne ke liye.
9.  Settings (chhota sa, zaroori): fee structure (class wise fee), due date, late fee rule, WhatsApp message ka template. Iske baghair voucher aur late fee ka hisaab nahi ban sakta, is liye ye shamil kiya hai.
2.2 Phone numbers ke baare mein (aapki baat ka matlab)
Sab bachon ke phone / WhatsApp numbers system mein save honge (koi bhi number likha ja sakta hai). Jis bache ke saath bhi kuch karna ho (fee ka kehna ho, tabiyat poochni ho, koi aur baat ho), uska number utha kar seedha Call ya WhatsApp kiya ja sakta hai. Har student ki row mein ye dono buttons hongay.
2.3 Ye nahi hoga (baad ke dusre ERP ke liye)
Upar jo likha hai bas wahi hoga. In cheezon ka is phase mein koi kaam nahi hoga:
• Attendance (bachon ya teachers ki hazri)
• Exams, result, report card, timetable
• Parent / student / teacher ka alag login ya portal
• Online payment (JazzCash, EasyPaisa, card, bank)
• Asli SMS ya WhatsApp Business API (yahan sirf WhatsApp link khulega)
• Transport, hostel, biometric, multi-branch
• Asli backend, server aur database (baad mein chahein to kar lenge)
Agar client in mein se kuch aur chahe to wo "Phase 2" mein dala ja sakta hai (dekhein Section 14).
