7. Zaroori User Flows
Flow A – Mahine ki fee ka poora chakkar
1.  Fees Overview → "Vouchers Banayein" → sab active bachon ke voucher ban jate hain.
2.  Vouchers List → class wise print → bachon ko diye jate hain.
3.  Bacha fee dene aaye → Voucher → "Fee Wasool Karein" → Receipt print.
4.  Due date guzar jaye → baqi vouchers par late fee khud lag jati hai.
5.  Defaulters list → Call / WhatsApp reminder.
Flow B – Maafi Voucher Detail → "Maafi Dein" → raqam / percentage + wajah → Net payable kam ho jata hai → save.
Flow C – Teacher ki salary Salary page → mahina chunein → "Salary Di Gayi" → date aur tareeqa → Slip print. Dashboard par "Salary Di / Baqi" khud badal jata hai.
Flow D – Kharcha likhna Expenses → "+ Naya Kharcha" → date, category, kis ko diya, raqam → save → Dashboard ka "Is Mahine ka Kharcha" aur Monthly Report khud update.
Flow E – Stock aur uska kharcha Stock → "Stock Barhao" → "Kharche mein likhein" → Expenses ka form bhara hua khulta hai → raqam daal kar save.
Flow F – Naya bacha Students → "+ Naya Bacha" → form → save → class ki tadaad aur dashboard khud barh jate hain.
8. Kaarobari Usool (Business Rules)
8.1 Monthly Voucher
• Har mahine ek button se (ya demo mein page khulne par) sab Active bachon ka voucher ban jata hai. Inactive bachon ka nahi.
• Fee = bache ki mahana fee (jo class ki fee se aati hai).
• Voucher number: V-YYYYMM-0001 jaisa.
• Ek bache ka ek mahine ka ek hi voucher (dobara na bane).
• Pichli baqi fee naye voucher mein "Arrears" ki line ban kar shamil hoti hai.
8.2 Late Fee
• Due date ke baad agar voucher Paid nahi to Settings ke rule ke mutabiq late fee lagti hai (fixed ya roz ke hisaab se).
• Late fee ki ek hadd (maximum) Settings mein rakhi ja sakti hai.
• Maafi ke zariye late fee bhi maaf ki ja sakti hai.
8.3 Maafi
• Raqam ya percentage, wajah zaroori. Receipt aur voucher par "Maafi" ki line nazar aati hai.
8.4 Receipt
• Har wasooli par ek receipt. Receipt No.: R-YYYYMM-0001. Partial payment par baqi raqam likhi aati hai.
8.5 Defaulter
• Jis bache ka koi voucher due date ke baad bhi Unpaid ya Partial ho.
8.6 Salary
• Har mahine har Active teacher ke liye ek salary entry (basic salary Teacher ke record se). Status: Baqi → Di gayi.
8.7 Kharcha
• Kharche ki category owner khud bana sakta hai. Dashboard aur Monthly Report in hi se hisaab lete hain.
