11.3 Mock API ka usool
• Har function async hai, 300–600ms ka nakli delay, taake loading spinner nazar aaye.
• Data mockDb se parha aur likha jata hai; mockDb apni halat localStorage mein rakhta hai.
• Galti ki soorat mein asli API jaisa error wapas ({ status, message }).
• Baad mein asli backend lagane ke liye: sirf src/api/ ke andar ke functions badalne honge (mockDb ki jagah fetch / axios). Pages aur components ko haath nahi lagana parega.
11.4 Zaroori Technical Baatein
• Login guard: bina login ke har route par /login. Login ki halat localStorage mein (demo token).
• Phone: 03xx-xxxxxxx ko 923xxxxxxxxx mein badal kar wa.me link banti hai; Call ke liye tel: link.
• B-Form validation: 13 digit, format xxxxx-xxxxxxx-x.
• Paisa: hamesha poore Rupay (integer) mein, dikhane ke waqt Rs. 1,500 jaisa format.
• Print: Voucher, Receipt, Salary Slip, Monthly Report ke liye alag print CSS (sidebar aur banner print mein nahi aate).
• Responsive: mobile par table kaarden (cards) ban jati hain, sidebar hamburger.
• Zuban: screen par zyada tar Roman Urdu labels; baad mein Urdu script ka option rakha ja sakta hai.
• Security note: demo mein password code ke andar hai, ye sirf dikhane ke liye hai. Asli system mein password server par hash ho kar rakhe jayenge.
